{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Athyra: Rock, Paper, Scissors",
    "steam_appid": 3645650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/144a743c9a875fb8a3ea6498229f4099.poster.avif?t=1747209422\" width=540 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/144a743c9a875fb8a3ea6498229f4099.webm?t=1747209422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/144a743c9a875fb8a3ea6498229f4099.mp4?t=1747209422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows\u2014Rock, Paper, Scissors\u2014and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity\u2014or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, it\u2019s a horror game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/d9d4331ff02b5457687ab8293084ea56.poster.avif?t=1747209422\" width=540 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/d9d4331ff02b5457687ab8293084ea56.webm?t=1747209422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/d9d4331ff02b5457687ab8293084ea56.mp4?t=1747209422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>In <i>Athyra</i>, you will...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted, unsettling opponents in the simplest game you've ever known... or thought you knew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic puzzles and unsettling lore as you venture deeper into the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms full of horrors, all linked by a bizarre, unnerving connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question everything... including the game itself.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/144a743c9a875fb8a3ea6498229f4099.poster.avif?t=1747209422\" width=540 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/144a743c9a875fb8a3ea6498229f4099.webm?t=1747209422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/144a743c9a875fb8a3ea6498229f4099.mp4?t=1747209422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows\u2014Rock, Paper, Scissors\u2014and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity\u2014or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, it\u2019s a horror game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/d9d4331ff02b5457687ab8293084ea56.poster.avif?t=1747209422\" width=540 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/d9d4331ff02b5457687ab8293084ea56.webm?t=1747209422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/d9d4331ff02b5457687ab8293084ea56.mp4?t=1747209422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>In <i>Athyra</i>, you will...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted, unsettling opponents in the simplest game you've ever known... or thought you knew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic puzzles and unsettling lore as you venture deeper into the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms full of horrors, all linked by a bizarre, unnerving connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question everything... including the game itself.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Athyra takes Rock, Paper, Scissors and turns it into a psychological horror trial full of puzzles, jumpscares, and cryptic lore. Inspired by Inscryption and Buckshot Roulette, Athyra pits you against disturbing foes in deadly games of Rock, Paper, Scissors...",
